  "title": "Holiday Dressing",
  "description": "This holiday stuffing recipe was shared by my friend. I have used it for over fifteen years. No other dressing will serve the purpose, according to my son.",
  "authors": [
    "Louise"
  ],
  "date_published": "1999-12-18T23:58:34-05:00",
  "date_modified": "2025-12-30T08:50:32-05:00",
